# Netlify: serve the single-page app for every path so /, /login, /profile, etc. all load
# index.html and React Navigation can read the URL. Required for Apple Return URLs that
# point at any path you registered (e.g. https://everycircle.com/ or .../login/).
# https://docs.netlify.com/routing/redirects/rewrites-proxies/#history-pushstate-and-single-page-apps
#
# Child Safety / CSAE standards must be a crawlable static HTML page (Google Play requirement).
# Keep these rules above the SPA catch-all so /child-safety is not rewritten to index.html.
/child-safety    /child-safety.html   200
/child-safety/   /child-safety.html   200
/*    /index.html   200
